      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Cochrane sits in the Bow Valley foothills, so lots tilt and the Town sets its own garage rules. Get two or three comparable written quotes from independent builders before the spring rush.</p>
