<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Garage building in Cochrane, the Bow Valley foothills town west of Calgary, comes down to two local facts: many lots slope, and the Town of Cochrane runs its own Land Use Bylaw, permits and fee schedule. Back Lane Garage Co is an advertising site that puts Cochrane homeowners in touch with independent garage builders. This site builds nothing itself, and the builder who quotes your job contracts directly with you.</p><p>Sahi Contracting, a builder with a Cochrane page, says a detached garage there typically ranges from $28,000 to $45,000 and that most take 3 to 5 weeks once permits are approved. Those are that builder's published figures, not a quote from this site, and the page does not say whether GST is included. The practical move is to ask two or three builders for comparable written quotes in winter, then call now to be put in touch.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Cochrane</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Cochrane Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Detached garages in Cochrane</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Single, double and triple garages on back-lane and street-access lots, quoted by independent builders who work with the Town's permit process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Garage packages</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Standard-size package quotes are the easiest to compare side by side. On a sloped Cochrane lot, ask what the package price assumes about the ground.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Custom and oversized garages</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Taller doors, deeper bays or a workshop. Anything bigger or taller than the Town's exemption limits goes through a development permit, so build that into your timeline.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 8px;">Replacing an old garage</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">If an older garage on your Cochrane lot is sagging or too small, a builder can quote the tear-down and the new build together. Ask for each as a separate line.</p>
      </div>
</div>
